# Production serves BOTH Micromart books. A customer is looked up across them
# at sign-in and the session is scoped to the one they are on.
#
# This file used to say VITE_ENTITY_ID=3005 — one book, chosen at build time,
# which locked out every Micromart Africa customer. Before that it said 7, an
# entity on a different platform entirely. The variable is gone because the
# shape was the bug, not the value.
#
#   3002 = MICROMART AFRICA LTD  (the SME / field book)
#   3005 = MICROMART FINTECH     (the app book — Micro Eazy products live here)
VITE_ENTITY_IDS=3002,3005

# New self-service registrations join the fintech book.
VITE_REGISTRATION_ENTITY_ID=3005
